name semlink-vn-fn
# instances/vn-fn2.json: SemLink's mapping of VerbNet classes to FrameNet frames, an object whose keys are classes,
# written by their numbers and a member's name (26.5-shake, 21.1-1-chip), each with the list of frames it maps to:
#   {"26.5-shake": ["Moving_in_place", "Body_movement", "Cause_to_move_in_place"], ...}
# The numeric class part resolves through the highway to its canonical VerbNet class (pluck-10.4.1-1), so the same
# class collides with VerbNet and PropBank. Each mapped FrameNet frame is attested as the pair of those two nodes.
match vn-fn2.json
format json
levels class

thing class key
type class.key vnclass matching ^(.*)-[^0-9-][^-]*$
type value fnframe

pair class value

maps class key vnclass matching ^(.*)-[^0-9-][^-]*$ to value fnframe
